  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a non-stick skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the olive oil and swirl to coat the pan.",
    "3. Add the mushroom duxelles and sauté for 2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "4. Add the flour and whisk until smooth, cooking for 1 minute.",
    "5. Add the Padron peppers and cook for 3-4 minutes on each side, until tender and slightly charred.",
    "6. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "7. Garnish with chopped parsley and serve immediately."
